{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月ですね〜"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月といえば七夕🎋🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "七夕といえば織姫と彦星....♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで何人かに私の織姫になってくれますか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と聞いてみました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "<蔵盛>"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高井「私の織姫になってくれますか？🥺」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "蔵盛「え、あんたが彦星側なん？」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "蔵盛が彦星になってくれるそうです。ありがとう。実はイケメンな蔵盛、LOVEです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "<片山>"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高井「7月といえばー？織姫と彦星！」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高井「私の織姫になってくれませんか？」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "片山「無理です(即答)」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高井「なんでですか！？」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "片山「私にはもう彦星がいるんで꒰ᐡ⸝ɞ̴̶̷ ·̮ ɞ̴̶̷⸝ᐡ꒱」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高井「！？誰ですか。。。！？」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "片山「にこちゃんɞ̴̶̷  ̫ ɞ̴̶̷」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さきにこ、尊いですね〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お幸せに。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "<鶴崎>"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高井「7月といえば〜？なんでしょう！」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鶴崎「七夕！」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鶴崎「あ織姫と彦星！」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鶴崎「え私たち付き合う？」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということでにこさんお馴染み、怒涛の畳み掛けによりまさかの鶴崎からのアプローチにより付き合うこととなりました(>ᴗ<)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嘘です、付き合いません...."}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ごめんね。にこさん。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobQZUTfu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mob6aGZDl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobK0EM53.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📸"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなこれ第22回イベント"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「アイスクリーム」です🍨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アイスクリーム屋さんになれてとても嬉しい☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きみのあいすやさーん🍨"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobLWbzkl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "𓆉𓂃◌𓈒𓐍◌𓈒 𓆟𓂃◌𓈒𓐍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月におすすめな楽曲⤵️7️⃣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【海風とわがまま🌊🏖️】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "個人的に日向坂の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "✨GODSONG✨"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なので是非聴いてください♬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五期生もいつか海風とわがままを披露したいな〜と思っています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてもう一つ7月といえば"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「五期生ライブですね！！」"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mob7bDu22.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五期生ライブに向けて頑張っています！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おひさまと最高の夏にしたいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "クリフハンガーのFNS歌謡祭"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7/1放送の「FNS歌謡祭 夏」欠席した代打で大田が出演してくれました(_ _)"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご心配、ご迷惑おかけした方々申し訳ございません。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、まずは五期生ライブにむけて全力で頑張りますのでよろしくお願いいたします！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobB327m4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして先日の「テレ東音楽祭2026初夏」では"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五期生での好きクレ披露ありがとうございました〜！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五期生ちゃん全員で音楽番組に出させていただけるなんて本当に光栄です（ ｉ _ ｉ ）⭐️"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "貴重な機会をありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五期生全員大好きです！"}, {"type": "break"},